CM Cardioid - L Network Feed
CM
CM ! Written by EZNEC/Pro+ v. 7.0 in NEC-2 format.
CM
CM ! *Wire #3 for virtual segments.
CM ! Wire #4 for I srcs, shorted/open TL, and/or parallel loads.
CM ! NT #1 is EZNEC current source
CM ! NT #2 is EZNEC L network
CM 
CM ! WARNING: MININEC-type ground may not work properly with standard
CM !          NEC-2 or -4 program.
CM
CM This is an example of a 2 element cardioid array fed with an L network
CM type feed system. The design of L network feed systems is described in
CM Chapter 8 of the 21st Edition of the ARRL Antenna book, and this array
CM is one of the examples. It wasn't possible to analyze this array/feed
CM system with EZNEC prior to v. 5.0, when the L network object was
CM introduced. This feed system delivers nearly identical results to the
CM all-transmission line feed system of example model Cardioid TL ARRL
CM Example.ez.
CM 
CM Step-by-step design of this model (beginning with Cardioid TL ARRL
CM Example.ez) is described in the "A Lap Around Track 5" section of the
CM Test Drive tutorial in the EZNEC manual.
CE
GW 1,30,0.,0.,0.,0.,0.,10.0584,.0127
GW 2,30,10.48226,0.,0.,10.48226,0.,10.0584,.0127
GW 3,4,4192.901,4192.901,4234.831,4193.069,4193.069,4234.998,.0041929
GW 4,3,4192.901,4192.901,4192.901,4193.027,4193.027,4193.027,.0041929
GE 1
LD 4,1,1,0,18.,0.
LD 4,2,1,0,18.,0.
FR 0,1,0,0,7.15
GN 1,0,0,0,0.,0.
EX 0,4,2,0,0.,1.414214
NT 4,2,3,2,0.,0.,0.,1.,0.,0.
TL 3,2,1,1,75.,10.48235,0.,0.,0.,0.
TL 3,3,2,1,75.,10.48235,0.,0.,0.,0.
NT 3,2,3,3,1.5041E-7,-1.226E-2,-1.504E-7,1.2264E-2,2.309E-7,-3.293E-3
GD 2,0,0,0,13.,.005,0.,0.
RP 3,1,361,1000,80.,0.,0.,1.,0.
EN
